{
"recipe_id":"24 Basque Burnt Cheesecake",
"source_text":"Recipe text（提取并整理后的流程文字）:\nIngredients:\n奶油奶酪 250g、细砂糖 40g、玉米淀粉 10g、常温鸡蛋 2 个、常温淡奶油 120g。\n1. 奶油奶酪提前回温软化。加入细砂糖和玉米淀粉，用刮刀压拌至细腻顺滑。也可以隔温水搅拌帮助软化。\n2. 将常温鸡蛋分约 3 次加入奶油奶酪混合物，每次充分搅拌均匀后再加入下一部分。\n3. 加入常温淡奶油，搅拌均匀。可以将面糊过筛 1–2 次，使质地更加丝滑。\n4. 6 寸模具中垫好油纸，将面糊倒入模具。\n5. 烤箱提前预热至 230°C / 450°F，烘烤 18–20 分钟。\n6. 出炉后蛋糕中心晃动属于正常现象。放至室温后，放入冰箱冷藏 至少 3 小时，之后切块。\nEnglish process:\nsoften cream cheese → add sugar and cornstarch → mix until smooth → gradually add eggs → mix until incorporated → add heavy cream → mix → optionally strain batter → line baking pan with parchment paper → pour batter into pan → preheat oven to 230°C → bake for 18–20 minutes → cool to room temperature → refrigerate for at least 3 hours → slice → finish",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "奶油奶酪提前回温软化", "text_en": "Let the cream cheese come to room temperature and soften in advance.", "start_char": 90, "end_char": 100, "node_indices": [1, 2], "edge_indices": [1], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "加入细砂糖", "text_en": "Add the fine granulated sugar.", "start_char": 101, "end_char": 106, "node_indices": [2, 3], "edge_indices": [2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 2, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "加入细砂糖和玉米淀粉", "text_en": "Add the cornstarch along with the fine granulated sugar.", "start_char": 101, "end_char": 111, "node_indices": [2, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 3, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "用刮刀压拌至细腻顺滑", "text_en": "Press and mix with a spatula until fine and smooth.", "start_char": 112, "end_char": 122, "node_indices": [2, 5], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 4, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "也可以隔温水搅拌帮助软化", "text_en": "Alternatively, stir over warm water to help soften it.", "start_char": 123, "end_char": 135, "node_indices": [5, 6], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 5, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "将常温鸡蛋分约 3 次加入奶油奶酪混合物", "text_en": "Divide the room-temperature eggs into approximately three additions for the cream-cheese mixture.", "start_char": 140, "end_char": 160, "node_indices": [7, 8, 9, 10], "edge_indices": [6, 7, 8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 7, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 7, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 8, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 8, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "将常温鸡蛋分约 3 次加入奶油奶酪混合物", "text_en": "Add the first of approximately three portions of room-temperature egg to the cream-cheese mixture.", "start_char": 140, "end_char": 160, "node_indices": [6, 8], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 9, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 9, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "每次充分搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir thoroughly until evenly incorporated after this addition.", "start_char": 161, "end_char": 169, "node_indices": [6, 11], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 10, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "将常温鸡蛋分约 3 次加入奶油奶酪混合物", "text_en": "Add the next portion of room-temperature egg to the cream-cheese mixture.", "start_char": 140, "end_char": 160, "node_indices": [9, 11], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 11, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 11, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "每次充分搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir thoroughly until evenly incorporated after this addition.", "start_char": 161, "end_char": 169, "node_indices": [11, 12], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 12, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 12, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "将常温鸡蛋分约 3 次加入奶油奶酪混合物", "text_en": "Add the remaining portion of room-temperature egg to the cream-cheese mixture.", "start_char": 140, "end_char": 160, "node_indices": [10, 12], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 13, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 13, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "每次充分搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir thoroughly until evenly incorporated after this addition.", "start_char": 161, "end_char": 169, "node_indices": [12, 13], "edge_indices": [14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 14, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 14, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "加入常温淡奶油", "text_en": "Add the room-temperature heavy cream.", "start_char": 182, "end_char": 189, "node_indices": [13, 14], "edge_indices": [15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 15, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 15, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir until evenly mixed.", "start_char": 190, "end_char": 194, "node_indices": [13, 15], "edge_indices": [16], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 16, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 16, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "可以将面糊过筛 1–2 次，使质地更加丝滑", "text_en": "Optionally strain the batter one or two times to make its texture even smoother.", "start_char": 195, "end_char": 216, "node_indices": [15, 16], "edge_indices": [17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 17, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "6 寸模具中垫好油纸", "text_en": "Line the 6-inch mold with parchment paper.", "start_char": 221, "end_char": 231, "node_indices": [], "edge_indices": [], "node_action_pairs": []}, {"id": "S017", "text": "将面糊倒入模具", "text_en": "Pour the batter into the mold.", "start_char": 232, "end_char": 239, "node_indices": [], "edge_indices": [], "node_action_pairs": []}, {"id": "S018", "text": "烤箱提前预热至 230°C / 450°F", "text_en": "Preheat the oven to 230°C / 450°F in advance.", "start_char": 244, "end_char": 265, "node_indices": [17, 18], "edge_indices": [18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 18, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S019", "text": "烘烤 18–20 分钟", "text_en": "Bake for 18–20 minutes.", "start_char": 266, "end_char": 277, "node_indices": [16, 18, 19], "edge_indices": [19, 20], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 19, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 19, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 20, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 20, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S020", "text": "放至室温后", "text_en": "Let the cake cool to room temperature.", "start_char": 298, "end_char": 303, "node_indices": [19, 20], "edge_indices": [21], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 21, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 21, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S021", "text": "放入冰箱冷藏 至少 3 小时", "text_en": "Refrigerate for at least 3 hours.", "start_char": 304, "end_char": 318, "node_indices": [20, 21], "edge_indices": [22], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 22, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 22, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S022", "text": "之后切块", "text_en": "Then cut the cake into pieces.", "start_char": 319, "end_char": 323, "node_indices": [21, 22], "edge_indices": [23], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 23, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 22, "edge_index": 23, "role": "output"}]}],
